WEBVTT

00:13:26.360 --> 00:13:30.120
Talented people don't want
to follow me anywhere.

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:33.679
They want to cocreate
with me the future.

00:13:33.679 --> 00:13:36.159
My job is to nurture the bottom-up

00:13:36.159 --> 00:13:39.519
and not let it degenerate into chaos."

00:13:39.519 --> 00:13:40.840
How did he see his role?

00:13:40.840 --> 00:13:43.639
"I'm a role model,
I'm a human glue,

00:13:43.639 --> 00:13:46.279
I'm a connector,
I'm an aggregator of viewpoints.

00:13:46.279 --> 00:13:48.519
I'm never a dictator of viewpoints."

00:13:48.519 --> 00:13:50.639
Advice about how you exercise the role?

00:13:50.639 --> 00:13:53.139
Hire people who argue with you.

00:13:53.139 --> 00:13:54.509
And, guess what?

00:13:54.509 --> 00:13:58.140
Sometimes it's best to be
deliberately fuzzy and vague.

00:13:59.220 --> 00:14:00.969
Some of you may
be wondering now,